// Location list must never offer a site that cannot clinically occur
// for the selected Condition Type (e.g. Diabetic Foot Ulcer + Coccyx
// must never be selectable). Each non-pressure-injury condition group
// below is restricted to the exact anatomical sites that condition
// type can actually occur at; conditions that may genuinely occur
// almost anywhere (Skin Tear, MASD/Excoriation, Rash/Bruising, Surgical
// Wound, Malignant Wound, Open Lesion, Other Skin Condition, and
// unclassified legacy rows) use a broader list so a real finding is
// never blocked, with "Other" always available as an escape valve.
