// recorded" chip for any assessment still carrying that exact
// historical value (manually entered previously, or written by the
// backend NUTR_MODIFIED_THICKENED_LIQUIDS Structured Findings mapping,
// which remains untouched/functional) -- no bespoke banner needed, and
// the stored value is never auto-rewritten.
//
// PRODUCT OWNER DECISION (2026-10-14, round 6) "Nutrition
// Simplification Review -- Merge NPO Into Diet Continuum" -- the
// `npoStatus` field is retired from active documentation entirely
// (NPO/NPO Except Meds moved into `NUTRITION_DIET_OPTIONS` above, so a
// nurse never has to document the same fact twice as both Diet and NPO
// Status). The option list once declared here is no longer referenced
// by any active field; it is removed rather than left as dead code.
// Any already-charted `npoStatus` value is preserved and shown
