// PRODUCT OWNER DECISION (2026-10-14, round 5) "Nutrition Workflow
// Correction -- Hospice-Native Diet Model" -- this card now also
// preserves read-only visibility of a legacy `dietOrderCategory` /
// `dietOrderDetails` value from before the Diet Order field was
