//
// PRODUCT OWNER DIRECTIVE (2026-10-14, round 2) "Endocrine Hospice
// Review" -- "Last HbA1c Value"/"Last HbA1c Date" are also retired from
// active documentation: HbA1c reflects long-term diabetes control, not
// a core hospice focus (current symptoms/risks/comfort/safety/immediate
// clinical concerns). Glucose Monitoring Frequency is explicitly KEPT
// (abnormal glucose can directly affect patient safety/comfort today).
//
// PRODUCT OWNER DIRECTIVE (2026-10-14, round 3) "Endocrine
// Simplification Review" -- "Thyroid Notes" is retired from the
// Thyroid Assessment card: maintaining both Thyroid Notes and the
// section-level Endocrine Notes created two competing narrative
// locations for the same information. Thyroid Assessment stays
// structured-findings-only (Normal/Enlarged/Tender/Nodular/Not
// Assessed); all narrative documentation now belongs in the single
// "Endocrine Notes" field. `thyroid.notes` has no
// structuredFindingRegistry.generated.js write mapping (confirmed), so
// unlike the fields above it is never voice/SFV-written -- but any
// already-charted value is still never deleted, same precedent.
//
// Same preserve-forever-read-only precedent as every other retired field
// in this file: all paths and any already-charted value (including
