  // Consistency, NPO, and Feeding Support Correction" -- Diet Order,
  // Food Texture, and Liquid Thickness are tracked as three fully
  // independent Coverage items (no cross-counting: documenting one does
  // NOT satisfy another). Food Texture/Liquid Thickness are not
  // required (excluded from Coverage, not silently marked complete)
