  // tracking of it is removed. "Food Texture"/"Liquid Thickness" below
  // are renamed to "Diet"/"Liquid Consistency" to match their renamed
  // cards -- same `foodTexture`/`liquidThickness` keys and paths, no
  // Coverage-logic change beyond the label.
  // PRODUCT OWNER DECISION (2026-10-14, round 6) "Nutrition
  // Simplification Review -- Merge NPO Into Diet Continuum" -- the
  // `applicable` gates below now derive "is this patient NPO" from
  // `foodTexture` itself (Diet === "NPO"), since NPO Status no longer
